{
  "_meta": {
    "notes": "A renovation, priced live against what the operator is typing. Nothing is spent at the press: a construction is not a purchase under RP-1, the project joins its queue and funds are drawn AS IT BUILDS at a rate that falls when the career is short, so a balance that does not cover the quote is a pace problem rather than a refusal. The two facts RP-1 discloses only afterwards are said first: it takes the complex's whole crew off for the whole build (ChangeEngineers(lc, -lc.Engineers) is the first thing it does), and a reduction is a bill rather than a refund. The complex's fluids are sent back verbatim because Rp1ComplexModifyArgs.resources is a SET whose absence means NONE, which is why rp1.complexes[].resourceCapacities is on the wire at all."
  },
